<title>USA: China buys 31,100 tonnes U.S. soybean meal.</title>
<headline>China buys 31,100 tonnes U.S. soybean meal.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>China bought 31,100 tonnes of U.S. soybean meal in the week ending Feb 27, U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday in its weekly Export Sales Report.</p>
<p>Net sales of U.S. soybean meal that were were 83,900 tonnes -- two and two-fifths times the week earlier and 12 percent above the four-week average, USDA said.</p>
